        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-79efc77a-b889-42c3-95a7-4d1a8db6bd09",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "The day starts early again. After breakfast, you have time for one more scheduled activity in the reserve. You then return to the lodge and get ready to leave.\n\nLunch is served at around 13:30 before departure. Afterwards, you cross the Andes towards the capital. You should reach your hotel in Quito between about 16:00 and 17:00. The exact time depends on traffic, the location of your hotel and the number of passengers.\n\nThe evening is free. The island leg of your trip begins the following day.\n\n**Accommodation:** Plaza Grande 5-star, Royal Suite.  \n**Meals:** breakfast, lunch."
    },
